  "description": "The Mariner V2 is our latest foldable eBike, featuring premium components such as hydraulic brakes, a powerful 500W (750W peak) motor, and standard Color LCD display with a USB charge port.\nIf you want the fun and power of the Yukon V2 in a smaller package, the Mariner V2 is perfect for you. It features the same powerful motor as the Yukon V2 but in a lighter frame with smaller, 20” diameter, 4” wide wheels. Ideal for trails, off-road adventures, and city trips, the motor offers 9 levels of pedal assist to help you conquer hills effortlessly.\nThis comfortable ride suits individuals 5’2” and taller, supporting up to 280 lbs. The strong frame and sturdy wheels are complemented by a 14Ah battery, tested to UL 2271 safety standards, offering a range of 50 to 60km on easy terrain.",
